# ROOFCAT: falling into a pit costs a life and turns Harissa into a spirit that
# flies and shoots; pressing A brings her back to life where the spirit is.
game roofcat
wait 5
cheat stage 0 1
cheat clear_foes
cheat cam 640
cheat put 30 83
wait 2
hold RIGHT 45
wait 40
expect lives == 2
expect spirit == 1
hold UP 40
press B
wait 5
expect stars == 0
wait 25
press A 2
wait 2
expect spirit == 0
expect lives == 2
